Engrave 'Elbereth' with your athame early and often.  Especially if you
have a means of levitating over it so as not to scuf it out waitintg
to heal.

Tatis #2:  Get a powerful pet that can kill monsters while doing #1.
Wishing for a blessed figurine of an Archon is great.  This guy will
wipe out the whole dungeon for you if you want (or at least the
whole gnome mines).  (Or course you dont want that, you want those
exp points, but if he's softening em up, you can kill em from over top
of Elbereth).

Strategy #1:  Be real slow and careful!

